function settingNumber(value:unknown,fallback=0){const text=String(value??'').trim();return text===''?fallback:Number(text)} async function saveSettings(){const payload={multiplier:settingNumber(settings.multiplier,1),labor_fee:settingNumber(settings.labor_fee),tax_rate_percent:settingNumber(settings.tax_rate_percent),freight:settingNumber(settings.freight),quote_valid_days:settingNumber(settings.quote_valid_days,15),max_discount_percent:settingNumber(settings.max_discount_percent),minimum_price:settingNumber(settings.minimum_price)};if(!Object.values(payload).every(Number.isFinite)){showAlert('请填写完整且有效的计价参数');return}if(payload.multiplier<1||payload.labor_fee<0||payload.tax_rate_percent<0||payload.tax_rate_percent>100||payload.freight<0||!Number.isInteger(payload.quote_valid_days)||payload.quote_valid_days<1||payload.quote_valid_days>365||payload.max_discount_percent<0||payload.max_discount_percent>100||payload.minimum_price<0){showAlert('计价参数超出允许范围，请检查输入值');return}try{await api('/api/admin/pricing-settings',{method:'PATCH',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});notice.value='计价参数已保存';await loadAdmin()}catch(e:any){showAlert(e.message)}}
